    old "[Player.Name]. I like sports and computers."
    new "[Player.Name]. Люблю спорт и компьютеры."

    # game/scripts/General/intro.rpy:250
    old "Cool. Good luck with that."
    new "Круто. Удачи с этим."

    # game/scripts/General/intro.rpy:252
    old "[Player.Name]. Drawing as in Drawterest mood boards or actual art?"
